se the board is about the payment.\n- **Detail:** one arrow per step in the brief, with no request or response bodies.\n- **Zones:** none, because four parties read fine without grouping.\n- **Title:** Roamstay checkout payment\n- **Subtitle:** Message order when a guest books and pays, success path only\n- **Source line:** Roamstay payments brief\n\n**Left out**\n- The payment provider's reply to the authorisation and any reply from the partner hub, because the brief doesn't state either.\n- A declined card and other failures, as you agreed.\n\nDoes this reading match the payments brief, or should a step, party or assumption change?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1990,"cache_read_input_tokens":57732,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1990},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ba842ce-43a3-4cdd-8ab9-5397cc637fef","uuid":"929f7672-b4e6-4482-bd06-16bd5b5a0a26","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:39:38.563Z","request_id":"req_011CgQwaC7NQyoUnvd1BU4wR"}
